1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,580
Keep running along, watch as we pass by,
as we raise our flag, up high in the sky.

2
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,550
Alright,

3
00:00:13,633 --> 00:00:18,011
here we go now, sailing through the
endless ocean, facing all that comes by.

4
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:23,980
Let's look for our treasure nobody has
ever got to witness with their own eyes.

5
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:29,617
All we have to do is keep believing in our
dreams, And let our heart lead the way!

6
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:33,820
Then once we got all the
others left is to go,

7
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:39,217
When we face the dark and stormy weather?

8
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:42,177
Keep the pace, we'll
link our hearts together!

9
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:45,700
Then I'm sure we'll make it through!

10
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:47,777
No matter what!

11
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:51,457
Keep running along, keep running along!

12
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:54,397
Start raising our flag as we journey on!

13
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:59,620
Though our chances are close to
none, We won't back down from anyone!

14
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:03,437
Let's start off the chase,
let's start off the chase!

15
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:06,397
Toward our own dreams,
while keeping the pace!

16
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,737
With a compass pointing to our goal!

17
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:13,460
We won't stop till we've
gone around the world!

18
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:15,900
Start me up!

19
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,417
Keep running along, keep running along!

20
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:24,357
And we'll never stop,
till we're at the top!

21
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:26,737
There's no way that we'll ever quit!

22
00:01:26,820 --> 00:01:29,380
Won't keep heading for tomorrow!

23
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:31,957
Let's start up the chase!

24
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,477
Let's start up the chase!

25
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,997
I see through your eyes!

26
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:36,397
What we'll have to face!

27
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:39,017
All the memories we'll say in our hearts!

28
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:41,297
We'll never let them go!

29
00:01:41,380 --> 00:01:43,380
Brand new world!

30
00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:45,880
Let's start me up!

31
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,617
What's Mosshead doing up there?

32
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:16,406
He's going to bring the
whole damn tower down.

33
00:02:26,380 --> 00:02:27,477
Who wrote this?

34
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:30,497
It says Gates of Justice.

35
00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:33,080
Guess I might as well follow it.

36
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:39,792
Nami and Usopp are probably
on their way to Robin already.

37
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:46,980
If this is the key they need,
I can't keep them waiting!

38
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,480
Better hurry.

39
00:02:56,620 --> 00:02:58,360
Can't you move any faster?

40
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,320
This is it!

41
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:10,794
At long last, the bridge of hesitation!

42
00:03:13,660 --> 00:03:15,140
Look, Nico Robin!

43
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:27,270
That's right.

44
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:29,401
The Gates of Justice are opening.

45
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:38,405
It took long enough, and I admit
it was scary for a while there,

46
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,060
but I finally made it.

47
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:43,917
Once I step through those gates,
I'll be the government's hero.

48
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:47,060
No, I will be a hero to the entire world.

49
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:53,437
The bridge leading to the
gate is rising as we speak.

50
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,800
Can you hear it?

51
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,980
It's calling out to its hero!

52
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:07,380
It's beautiful!

53
00:04:07,740 --> 00:04:11,460
A path into the horizon as
radiant as my shining future!

54
00:04:13,500 --> 00:04:17,860
Although, for you it must look like
a path straight to hell, right?

55
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:20,535
That's what you're thinking, isn't it?

56
00:04:20,900 --> 00:04:22,700
Well, take a good look!

57
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:47,097
I'm sick of chasing you around damn it
for the last time you can't escape so.

58
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:51,997
Give it a rest you obstinate cow I'm
the hero of the entire world and that?

59
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:54,777
Means I'm different than
you, better than you!

60
00:04:54,860 --> 00:04:57,557
Have I finally gotten that
through your thick skull?

61
00:04:57,640 --> 00:05:00,560
Or do I need to keep
grinding it in for you?

62
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:07,320
Luffy, everyone, I still believe in you.

63
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:13,400
Come on, hurry, hurry!

64
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:16,308
There's no point if I
don't make it in time!

65
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:18,040
Is that the exit?

66
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,280
Ten minutes until we arrive.

67
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,031
All hands are ready, sir.

68
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:30,257
All ships confirm positions
and prepare for attack.

69
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:31,170
Yes, sir!

70
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,680
Now get up!

71
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:34,500
Show some dignity.

72
00:05:35,580 --> 00:05:37,756
You're not going to ruin this for me.

73
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,480
Did I make it?

74
00:05:51,260 --> 00:05:52,090
Whoa!

75
00:05:52,173 --> 00:05:53,374
Calm down, straw-head!

76
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,280
Huh, it's freaky!

77
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,177
I got enough jerks to deal with!

78
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:58,090
Get lost!

79
00:05:58,173 --> 00:05:59,003
What?

80
00:05:59,086 --> 00:06:00,897
You mean you're still playing
tough after all we've been through?

81
00:06:00,980 --> 00:06:02,080
We're bros now!

82
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:03,380
Just deal with it!

83
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,110
Lucci, huh?

84
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:09,617
You giving you a hard time or something?

85
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:11,759
By the way, I brought you two keys.

86
00:06:11,900 --> 00:06:13,677
Well, I guess Robin's not here.

87
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:14,997
Should I lend you a hand?

88
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:15,910
No.

89
00:06:15,993 --> 00:06:17,115
Leave this guy to me.

90
00:06:17,740 --> 00:06:19,580
You should go after Robin.

91
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:24,657
You can get to the Gates of Justice
through that door behind the pigeon guy.

92
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:27,858
Robin left a while back so
we're running out of time!

93
00:06:28,580 --> 00:06:30,960
Keep going and don't look back.

94
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:35,580
You can super count on me brother.

95
00:06:51,180 --> 00:06:56,140
Listen, just so we're straight here,
despite my appearance, I prefer meat.

96
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:01,707
Well, just so we're straight
here, I really don't give a damn.

97
00:07:04,620 --> 00:07:06,340
Anyway, enough small talk.

98
00:07:06,580 --> 00:07:07,777
I gotta get that key.

99
00:07:07,860 --> 00:07:10,919
If I can't make it in time,
this is all for nothing.

100
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,480
Two-sword style. Nigiri.

101
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:25,874
Are you supposed to get stronger when
you wear that bandana on your head?

102
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:27,260
Let's find out.

103
00:07:31,020 --> 00:07:32,320
Tower climb!

104
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,460
Tower climb!

105
00:07:36,780 --> 00:07:37,660
I can't!

106
00:07:40,780 --> 00:07:41,610
Flash!

107
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,390
Triple!

108
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:47,877
You've given yourself a blind spot.

109
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,780
Giraffe Scythe!

110
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:01,580
Iron body, edgewise.

111
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,200
What?

112
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:16,077
There's no blind spots.

113
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,820
on a square.

114
00:08:18,780 --> 00:08:19,610
So what?

115
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,367
If he can't move, who cares?

116
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:23,200
You're so naive.

117
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:25,717
Perhaps I should remind you of something.

118
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,630
Yeah?

119
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:29,020
Unlike humans,

120
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,420
giraffes have four legs.

121
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,790
Tempest kick!

122
00:08:34,300 --> 00:08:36,697
Are you gonna fight me or just sit there?

123
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:37,610
What do you mean?

124
00:08:37,693 --> 00:08:38,523
Take a look.

125
00:08:38,606 --> 00:08:39,907
My attack has already begun.

126
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:44,380
First, the slashes go up.

127
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:46,077
They deflect off the ceiling.

128
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:49,400
And then finally, they come raining down?

129
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:52,180
Giraffe shower!

130
00:08:56,980 --> 00:08:58,480
Iron body.

131
00:09:05,660 --> 00:09:07,140
There's too many.

132
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:22,060
A nose pistol!

133
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:49,630
Bastard.

134
00:09:49,713 --> 00:09:53,480
You're quite resilient for a
human, but I'm a giraffe boy.

135
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:57,680
That's your superhero name, Giraffe Boy?

136
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,020
Giraffe Boy?

137
00:09:59,220 --> 00:10:00,760
It's just giraffe, fool.

138
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:02,254
Now it's giraffe fool?

139
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:03,461
You're the fool.

140
00:10:03,660 --> 00:10:05,080
I'm the giraffe. Got it?

141
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,680
Listen to yourself, hmm?

142
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:11,998
Who the hell cares if you're
giraffe boy or whatever?

143
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:15,973
If you're a swordsman, then
let your blade speak for you.

144
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:20,718
If you think you can get under my
skin, you're just wasting your time.

145
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,722
I'm not getting under your skin.

146
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:25,420
I'm gonna cut straight through it.

147
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:29,940
And if you use your iron body,
I'll cut through that too.

148
00:10:31,420 --> 00:10:32,780
One sword style.

149
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,720
Sword draw.

150
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:39,850
Lion.

151
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:41,550
Song!

152
00:10:41,860 --> 00:10:42,880
Tempest kick!

153
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:45,700
Dragon cut!

154
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:50,590
Hmph.

155
00:10:50,780 --> 00:10:52,420
Iron body isn't the issue.

156
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:57,100
If you can't cut me at all, it doesn't
matter if my body's iron or not.

157
00:11:00,620 --> 00:11:01,450
You're right.

158
00:11:01,533 --> 00:11:03,814
I'll have to take a different approach.

159
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,077
One gorilla.

160
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:13,760
Two gorilla. Now. Again.

161
00:11:16,420 --> 00:11:19,797
three-sword style a test of strength

162
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:24,040
this time is it sounds fun to me nose

163
00:11:32,100 --> 00:11:34,680
This is truly a fearsome attack!

164
00:11:43,420 --> 00:11:46,080
You never thought you might lose, did you?

165
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:49,713
You can't even imagine that
I might be stronger than you.

166
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,600
Well, it's time to wake up.

167
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,040
I'll make you face the truth.

168
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,080
I could say the same thing.

169
00:12:07,860 --> 00:12:09,060
Paper art.

170
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:30,120
Straw Hat!

171
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:34,381
Ten-thirty king!

172
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:44,320
Weapons left!

173
00:12:45,500 --> 00:12:46,330
Shit!

174
00:12:48,380 --> 00:12:50,240
Kum-kum!

175
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:51,870
Rocket!

176
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:56,640
What happened?

177
00:12:56,820 --> 00:12:57,720
I'm gone!

178
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,440
Mazooka!

179
00:13:02,420 --> 00:13:08,800
You still haven't seen the true,
wild strength of a giraffe.

180
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:11,600
Then stop talking and show me already.

181
00:13:11,940 --> 00:13:13,960
It would be my pleasure.

182
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:18,600
Observe, for this is the power of nature.

183
00:13:20,860 --> 00:13:22,140
Giraffe cannon!

184
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:25,780
There's nothing natural about that.

185
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:28,200
Extreme nose pistol!

186
00:13:28,940 --> 00:13:30,080
Giraffe blast!

187
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:32,010
Extract!

188
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:36,900
But it's like I said, that neck
of yours is your weak point.

189
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:40,140
Keep telling yourself that. Tempest kick!

190
00:13:40,500 --> 00:13:41,960
Spinning white blade!

191
00:13:47,380 --> 00:13:50,637
Why don't you worry about your
own weak points instead of mine?

192
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:51,550
Ha!

193
00:13:51,633 --> 00:13:52,717
What's with this guy?

194
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:54,757
These attacks just keep getting weirder.

195
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,660
You won't get away next time.

196
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:58,842
Giraffe cannon!

197
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:02,610
Dammit!

198
00:14:02,693 --> 00:14:05,537
I pushed my neck in so far, it
made my arms and legs pop out.

199
00:14:05,620 --> 00:14:07,677
What could have messed
up, buddy, have you got?

200
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:11,417
It's like when you cram dough through a
little hole and it comes out as noodles.

201
00:14:11,500 --> 00:14:12,940
Like a pasta machine.

202
00:14:17,780 --> 00:14:18,610
Pasta machine!

203
00:14:18,693 --> 00:14:20,757
Don't act like you did that on purpose!

204
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:25,580
A long neck is nice, but long
limbs like these are handy as well.

205
00:14:26,140 --> 00:14:31,420
A pro like me can turn even the most
unexpected situations into fresh opportunities.

206
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:36,440
Behold as I unleash a devastating
new long-range technique.

207
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:39,540
Giraffe Blast!

208
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,878
Does the same attack you did before!

209
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:44,581
I've had enough of this nonsense.

210
00:14:45,740 --> 00:14:48,460
Resort style. Tatsu.

211
00:14:48,820 --> 00:14:50,200
Margellion button!

212
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,620
It's too strong!

213
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:04,390
Moonwalk!

214
00:15:04,473 --> 00:15:05,303
Now what?

215
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:09,031
It can't be running away.

216
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:13,860
Pasta machine!

217
00:15:17,380 --> 00:15:19,060
Thank you for waiting.

218
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,620
Never mind the neck.

219
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:29,291
If I can control the reach of all four
limbs, my blades will be unstoppable.

220
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:34,437
Perhaps you were so distracted
by my giraffe powers

221
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:37,697
that you forgot I'm a master
of the four-sword style.

222
00:15:37,780 --> 00:15:41,120
You've done well thus far,
but this battle is over now.

223
00:15:44,660 --> 00:15:47,340
Even if you have the
power of a wild animal.

224
00:15:48,020 --> 00:15:51,020
Even if you can attack
with a long neck of yours.

225
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:55,000
Even if you can use a four sword style.

226
00:16:00,900 --> 00:16:01,730
What?

227
00:16:01,813 --> 00:16:04,040
He deflected all four blades?

228
00:16:06,660 --> 00:16:11,540
None of those things will give you
the strength it takes to defeat me.

229
00:16:17,040 --> 00:16:18,120
Three-sword style.

230
00:16:19,940 --> 00:16:20,770
Leopard.

231
00:16:22,380 --> 00:16:23,210
Spinning!

232
00:16:23,980 --> 00:16:26,620
Is he flying at me?

233
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:38,830
Impossible.

234
00:16:38,913 --> 00:16:40,442
I thought for sure he missed me.

235
00:16:45,420 --> 00:16:46,500
What was that?

236
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:53,100
Did he somehow predict
which way I would dodge?

237
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:58,200
Oh, come on.

238
00:16:58,380 --> 00:16:59,417
Don't look so surprised.

239
00:16:59,500 --> 00:17:02,297
The way you fight I find
it hard to believe this

240
00:17:02,380 --> 00:17:05,262
is the first time you've
been touched by a blade?

241
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:09,117
Well it seems you have a little
something to back up your boast!

242
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:11,100
I won't underestimate you again

243
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:14,097
but I'm afraid that one hit is
the best you're going to do.

244
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:19,177
I have four swords six powers and the
immeasurable strength of a giraffe on my side.

245
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:21,997
That's an equation for victory
if I've ever heard one.

246
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:23,200
So don't blink.

247
00:17:23,460 --> 00:17:25,160
This will be over in a flash

248
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:36,420
Now, Giraffe Flaps!

249
00:17:38,380 --> 00:17:39,600
Damn it!

250
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:43,740
My neck's like a whip.

251
00:17:45,580 --> 00:17:46,540
Whiplash!

252
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,780
Even faster!

253
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:56,220
Fierce Smash!

254
00:17:58,040 --> 00:17:59,920
How do you like this? Yes!

255
00:18:00,220 --> 00:18:01,985
Still think you can defeat me?

256
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:07,720
And now for a taste of
my four-sword style.

257
00:18:08,500 --> 00:18:09,700
Prepare yourself.

258
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:13,460
Fury Slash!

259
00:18:18,620 --> 00:18:19,800
Here I come.

260
00:18:24,140 --> 00:18:25,220
Barely keep up.

261
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:26,579
Hey, what's wrong?

262
00:18:26,700 --> 00:18:28,137
All you're doing is blocking.

263
00:18:28,220 --> 00:18:29,050
Give it up!

264
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:31,833
You don't have what it takes to beat me.

265
00:18:35,500 --> 00:18:38,257
You pirates were sorely
mistaken if you thought

266
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:41,164
you could defy the world
government and survive.

267
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:46,211
In the name of justice, a mistake that
